Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Tile ringer song x2
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.24,0:00:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars\Nand reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.34,0:00:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow. If we triumph!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.67,0:00:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, emos Saru the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.22,0:00:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go baby baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.32,0:00:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, baby, baby, oh\Nwe share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.52,0:00:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to see for you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.78,0:00:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the darkness\Nthat is in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So hard to see, but to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In where we need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you and me, it's true that we.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the rush brought up by this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Through head to feet, I feel the beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting me to walk on, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times, take my hand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.98,0:00:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.32,0:01:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.56,0:01:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.02,0:01:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.94,0:01:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh as we chase we're being chased.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.90,0:01:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,From the top we go on straight and wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.70,0:01:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way. I've got to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.80,0:01:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I want to share your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.48,0:01:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here it starts, so don't lose heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.74,0:01:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bound to lose to this flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,From boot to hood, I feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be free to be, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.40,0:01:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, even if I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, I know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times, show us that smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.98,0:01:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.38,0:01:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.54,0:01:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.00,0:01:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.78,0:01:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go, beyond far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:02:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow if we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.58,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you are there,\Njust on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait there for me, soon\Nit will be you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.78,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let us go, beyond far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in the one world if we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.14,0:02:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.96,0:02:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.00,0:02:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you guys doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.54,0:02:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help there, Straw\NHat. Yeah, thank you, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.92,0:02:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys done with yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.78,0:02:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.10,0:02:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys really are\Namazing, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:02:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to your food, I'm\Nfighting on a full stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys didn't know what hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.32,0:03:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.94,0:03:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't stand a chance back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.36,0:03:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not ready for a 300 million bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.32,0:03:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, you might be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.84,0:03:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But just think about how many big\Nshots are on the archipelago right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.52,0:03:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We can at least back one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.80,0:03:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,can't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.71,0:03:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so perplexed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.92,0:03:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.28,0:03:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're being bombarded with\Nbounty hunters left and right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.16,0:03:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's three times\Nwe've been ambushed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And the taste testing, oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,sorry, I mean souvenir shops.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.16,0:03:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They've all disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.28,0:03:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.19,0:03:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,it's kind of spooky seeing all these empty\Nbuildings and no people walking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.96,0:03:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like a sketchy location for a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.62,0:03:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,coding mechanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.53,0:03:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You, you gotta keep in mind\Nhow huge this archipelago is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The government can't Keep a\Nwatchful eye on all of it, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.98,0:03:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marines won't even go\Nanywhere near this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.20,0:03:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A map of the islands?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It covers the whole archipelago with\Nthe groves grouped into clusters of ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.58,0:04:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The borders aren't as clear-cut\Nin reality, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.18,0:04:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, these are all the\Nareas we've passed through so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.98,0:04:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Grove 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.34,0:04:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's part of Cluster 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.58,0:04:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Groves 1 through 29 are more or\Nless known as the Lawless area.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.98,0:04:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why the place is crawling\Nwith so many bounty hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.18,0:04:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And you couldn't have mentioned\Nthat before we left the dock?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.70,0:04:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'd known that, I would have\Nlet Zoro or Sanji come instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.98,0:04:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.48,0:04:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Our destination, Grove 13,\Nis just around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.60,0:04:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my gosh, Chopper Chin, you and\NSkeleton Chin were really cool back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make me\Nfeel better, you jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm blushing so hard,\Neven my ears are red.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.42,0:04:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.70,0:04:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.12,0:04:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.34,0:04:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the shop there\Non top of that big root.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.34,0:04:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hope they're still open.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been ten years since\Nthe last time I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.52,0:04:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kuma, is this boat-coding mechanic\Nfriend of yours a fish man, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.08,0:05:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, that's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.68,0:05:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Papagu and I haven't met him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.24,0:05:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard he's the absolute\Nbest there is, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I thought you guys knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.44,0:05:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is called\NShockey's Rip-Off Bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.24,0:05:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hachi, I've got a sneaking suspicion\Nthey're planning on ripping us off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.20,0:05:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This coding mechanic isn't going to\Nbeat us up and take our money, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.62,0:05:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They're good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.36,0:05:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've known them since I was\Nno bigger than you, Papa Goo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.10,0:05:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't say this place was a bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.40,0:05:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like\Nthey're still in business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh, Chaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.86,0:05:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey! Come on in.\NWhat can I get for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.64,0:05:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on is that really you Hatchan
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,i haven't seen you in ages you i know
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,sorry it's been so long Chaka me too\Nit's been at least 10 years hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.40,0:05:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Make yourselves comfortable i won't be\Nanother minute i just need to collect
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.52,0:06:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,some money these boys don't owe me\Nyeah sure take your time thanks son!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, so you gave up the pirate\Nlife, hot chum, yeah, a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.40,0:06:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,happened well i'm proud of you\Nan honest life is the best life
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.22,0:06:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,gotta say it's not too often\Nthat you come across a mermaid
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.18,0:06:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,above water like this so Kuma\Nare you hot chon's girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.02,0:06:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No i'm sorry but no hot chon's great and\Nall but no i'm way too young to get married
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.94,0:06:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,that's not what girlfriend\Nmeans Kuma works
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.16,0:06:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,with me at my fried octopus fritter stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.48,0:06:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.76,0:06:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I get you guys some...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.32,0:06:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,One compliment, Chaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.78,0:06:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,These boiled beans are delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.22,0:06:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They're raiding the fridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Goofy, Brooke, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop before she rips you up! It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.58,0:06:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.28,0:06:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.19,0:06:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got something you'll like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.82,0:06:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,too, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.32,0:06:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Cotton candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.88,0:06:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, thank you! Well, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:06:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And that'll just be 100,000 berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.06,0:07:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.06,0:07:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have that fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No, honey, it was just a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't charge friends of Hot John's\Nand I sure wouldn't rip them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know that's Topper's favorite\Nfood, lady? It was easy. You're Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.44,0:07:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.35,0:07:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hey, you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.60,0:07:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.51,0:07:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's talking about your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.08,0:07:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And I work to stay well-informed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.46,0:07:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you hear that, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.56,0:07:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're famous! Although,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you had a\Nskeleton in your crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.92,0:07:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,or that skeletons were\Ncapable of moving and talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.96,0:07:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, that should be\Nwarm enough. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I read an article on you guys recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.58,0:07:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It was about the Annie's lobby incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.66,0:07:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm curious how much is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.60,0:07:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you guys really pick a\Nfight with the world government?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.28,0:07:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.56,0:07:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long, boring story.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.26,0:07:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Not much for bragging, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.96,0:07:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be a big shot
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.62,0:08:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,One thing I was curious about Are you\Nrelated to the naval officer monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.06,0:08:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Garp? I sure am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.36,0:08:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Garp's my grandpa That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.40,0:08:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A long time ago, he used to\Nchase me all over the sea. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.52,0:08:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a time when Chaka was a\Nnotorious pirate herself Whoa, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.10,0:08:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, it's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.10,0:08:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But I washed my hands\Nof it 40 years ago now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.68,0:08:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, 40 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How old are you, lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.00,0:08:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Old enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but these days I just get my kicks\Nfrom cheering on rookies like you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Which brings us to why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.20,0:08:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.64,0:08:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I already know the whole story.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.68,0:08:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Kuma trekked up\Non land and made the long,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.44,0:08:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,uncomfortable journey to\Nthe shop in order to help
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey and his crew here\Nget their ship coated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.26,0:08:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that about sum it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was delicious! Try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So long story short, you have a\Ncoat job for Rayleigh, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.17,0:08:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.34,0:08:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I hate to tell you,\Nbut he's not here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.48,0:08:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.39,0:08:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mechanic's not here, but we're\Ntrying to get down to Fishman Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.84,0:09:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can guarantee you he's still\Non the archipelago, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.16,0:09:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your best bet would probably be to search\Nfor him in the bars or gambling houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.88,0:09:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, it'd be easier to just\Nwait until he gets back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.56,0:09:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.54,0:09:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.80,0:09:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be back eventually, but\Nhe's been gone for half a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.02,0:09:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Half a year?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.34,0:09:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's shacked up with\Nsome girl he met at a bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.84,0:09:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't really say I'm\Ntoo worried about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.62,0:09:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just natural behavior for\Nan old ex-pirate to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.32,0:09:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They go exploring and take\Ntheir time coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're saying the\Nmechanic was a pirate too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.72,0:09:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's certainly a conundrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But if he's not here, then I suppose we\Nhave no choice but to find him ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.58,0:09:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you perhaps tell us which groves\Nwe should start searching first?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.64,0:09:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.92,0:09:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had to guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.00,0:09:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say you're most likely to find him\Nsomewhere between Grove 1 and Grove 29.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's quite notorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't relax if there's a\Nrisk of running into the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.62,0:09:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's your best bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:09:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But if that place doesn't\Nwork out, try Sabo Odi Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.76,0:10:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He likes it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.70,0:10:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The amusement park?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.18,0:10:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's where we're looking first!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.56,0:10:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma, cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.70,0:10:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Amusement park!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.74,0:10:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Amusement park!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.22,0:10:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, make sure you're careful\Nwherever you end up looking for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,According to my network of contacts,\Nyou've got some infamous company out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.26,0:10:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,With your arrival on the\NSabo Odi Archipelago,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.22,0:10:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,there are now 11 people with bounties\Nexceeding 100 million berries on the groves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.86,0:10:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 11 people with\Nbounties that high? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.78,0:10:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Adding Roro Noah and Monkey\Nhere to the list, you've got 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.04,0:10:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So there are nine others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.08,0:10:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You had a choice to make when\Nyou crossed the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There were seven sea routes\Nthat would lead you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And after you picked one, you followed\Nyour Log Pose the rest of the way, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.78,0:10:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.78,0:10:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, naturally, these other pirates picked\None of the six routes you chose not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.16,0:11:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And trust me, they went through just\Nas much trouble as you did to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.36,0:11:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter which route you take.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.36,0:11:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You eventually hit the red line.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And everyone winds up on this archipelago
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,with the hopes of getting\Npast that giant wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.68,0:11:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit crazy that\Nall of the world's best
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,rookies managed to show\Nup here at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.41,0:11:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And such a notorious lot at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.28,0:11:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,At the top, you've got Kidd,\Nyourself, Hawkins, Drake, and Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.56,0:11:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing you must\Nhave seen these other
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.34,0:11:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,names in the newspapers\Nalongside your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.80,0:11:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't read newspapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.58,0:11:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Information is a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.36,0:11:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be a smart move to at least\Nlearn the names of your rivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.38,0:11:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so there was Kidd, Hawkins,\Nand, uh, it was Drake, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.22,0:11:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Her appetite is terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.50,0:11:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How could she even fit all\Nthat food into her body?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.78,0:11:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,More!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:11:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring more food!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.14,0:12:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What a vulgar woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.40,0:12:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the cider has making\Nme lose my appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.34,0:12:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, wire, jaw, shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.24,0:12:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a good idea, father.\NWe're right by Navy headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.48,0:12:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The last thing we need to cause a scene
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Capone gang bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.34,0:12:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a bounty of a hundred and thirty\Neight million berries on his head
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the rest of the food?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.66,0:12:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and bring it before I starve
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.78,0:12:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, the waiter swears they're\Ncooking it as fast as they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.34,0:12:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.25,0:12:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not fast enough, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.26,0:12:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Pizza! More pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Jewelry Bonnie, a .k .a. The Glutton.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.46,0:12:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Her bounty, 140 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.34,0:12:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.25,0:12:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have your food for you immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.92,0:12:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so, so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.76,0:13:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.00,0:13:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave him be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.58,0:13:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm soaked in spaghetti.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.78,0:13:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Such was the fate of your pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize for my man threatening you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.82,0:13:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking a life on this day will\Nonly bring our crew bad fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.48,0:13:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Basil Hawkins, the magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.96,0:13:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a bounty of 249 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.58,0:13:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They're fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you really not wait for the\Nother side of the red line to fight me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.20,0:13:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just curious, but do you\Nhave any clue who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.70,0:13:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sea Roar, Scratchman Apu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.60,0:13:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The bounty on his head\Nis 198 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.88,0:13:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All I know is you wouldn't\Nstop staring at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.34,0:13:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, please don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.38,0:14:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You are one creepy-looking bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.24,0:14:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just let me\Nput you out of your misery?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.80,0:14:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Eustass Captain Kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,His bounty, 315 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.84,0:14:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The mad bone's on a rampage!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.28,0:14:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get out of here\Nbefore he levels the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.48,0:14:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to go wild,\Nsave it for the new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.00,0:14:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Flag Diaz Drake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.40,0:14:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a bounty of 222 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.96,0:14:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.46,0:14:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the fallen Navy officer, Drake?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:14:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mad Monk Uruge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a bounty worth 108 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.10,0:15:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You should get down on your knees and\Nthank Drake for your life, masked man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.18,0:15:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The Massacre Soldier, killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.04,0:15:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,His bounty, 162 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, it was just starting to get good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Drake, I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How many people have you killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.42,0:15:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar Law, the Surgeon of Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.16,0:15:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,His bounty is 200 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.92,0:15:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know, a countless number of\Npirate crews have entered the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.22,0:15:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but only a handful have made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.96,0:15:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line is basically an\Nenormous tournament of survival,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.02,0:15:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,regardless of which path\Nthey took to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.64,0:15:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones that made it are\Nthe cream of the crop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.42,0:15:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd even go so far as to say\Nthat one of them might go
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.30,0:16:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,on to become the leader of the\Nnext generation of pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.16,0:16:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So fair warning!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.40,0:16:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,With this many rookies passing\Nthe red line at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.68,0:16:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are bound to get\Nquite ugly in the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.38,0:16:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.29,0:16:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,in case you're wondering why Captain\NKidd's bounty is so much higher than yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.94,0:16:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because he has no qualms\Nwith attacking innocent civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.82,0:16:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not very charming, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.86,0:16:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I prefer you boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.62,0:16:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on my support.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be cheering for you all the way
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.72,0:16:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but I gotta be honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.24,0:16:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to have fun
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But you do have me a little\Nafraid for the old coding
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,mechanic pirate guy this\Ntown sounds pretty rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.42,0:16:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh you've got nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.68,0:16:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, Rayleigh's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.80,0:16:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a hundred times stronger than you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.64,0:16:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she say a hundred times?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.88,0:17:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,you ready chomper yeah just so you\Nknow i'm sure the navy is aware that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.52,0:17:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,all you up and coming heavy-hitting\Npirates have made landfall here i'd
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.30,0:17:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,keep an eye out for anything suspicious\Nif i were you now that's not good
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.58,0:17:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,so you're saying they could strike\Nat any time from out of nowhere Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.66,0:17:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but you might be in luck\Nin addition to the usual
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.08,0:17:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,troublemakers around\Nthese parts With all the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.64,0:17:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,other pirates landing\Nhere at the same time Navy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,headquarters probably has\Nits hands full right now
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.90,0:17:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless something especially\Nproblematic happens
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.52,0:17:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the Navy won't waste major\Nmilitary resources on
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.16,0:17:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,checking it out In other\Nwords keep your heads down
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.02,0:17:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,try not to cause any trouble\Nand you should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.64,0:17:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.47,0:17:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.56,0:17:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a real big help
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.96,0:17:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you they were crazy strong\Nsounds like you had a rough time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.94,0:17:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's this proposition of yours right
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.36,0:18:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry sir you see\Nmaster peterman I think
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.48,0:18:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the Girl with Straw Hat luffy might be a
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.46,0:18:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,mermaid I noticed something\Nwhen I saw her before
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,After she fell to the ground her shoe came
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,off when it did I saw\Na fin instead of a foot
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.92,0:18:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But these strong companions you mentioned\Nsound like they could be a lot of trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.32,0:18:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonetheless, a mermaid spotted on dry\Nland is certainly a golden opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.58,0:18:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They're impossible to catch in open water.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.04,0:18:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate all the info.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.04,0:18:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You came to the right man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.78,0:18:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And for that info, you can\Nhave 10 % of her selling price.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.30,0:18:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we were really hoping for 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, 10 % is plenty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.10,0:19:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.56,0:19:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Savoni Park! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.52,0:19:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.74,0:19:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This place looks fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.88,0:19:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.79,0:19:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember why we're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.71,0:19:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.68,0:19:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That lady said this is where\Nwe should look for him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Only if we couldn't find\Nhim in the lawless area.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.04,0:19:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so fair as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.87,0:19:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen it\Nfrom this class before?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.86,0:19:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.48,0:19:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fun time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.16,0:19:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not even trying to find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.20,0:19:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.28,0:19:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma, you are forbidden\Nto step inside that place!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely forbidden!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.90,0:19:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My, what a lovely and\Nleisurely ride this is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.44,0:19:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and look at this view, how relaxing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.06,0:20:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, gentle rides like\Nthis one are more my style.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This way I can still enjoy the\Nlovely view without having to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.18,0:20:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster, faster, faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.68,0:20:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster! Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.52,0:20:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is wrong with you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.66,0:20:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who in the right minds\Nwould spend that hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.68,0:20:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.64,0:20:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's going to pay for all this damage?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.62,0:20:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.92,0:20:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're so high up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.56,0:20:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, over here, the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.06,0:20:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.88,0:20:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.40,0:21:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the most amazing\Nthing I've ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.88,0:21:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the crying\Nall about? It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.14,0:21:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I've dreamed of this moment\Never since I was a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.34,0:21:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been so high\Nup in the air before!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.78,0:21:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always remember this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.26,0:21:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.64,0:21:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have come here without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hatchan and Papaku only let me come to this\Nplace because I knew you'd keep me safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.70,0:21:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.62,0:21:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta admit, I'm probably every\Nbit as happy as Kuma is right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.88,0:21:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Every mer-child and fish kid\Ndreams of coming to this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.70,0:21:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,though not many of us get to really do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.78,0:21:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So high! So high!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.94,0:21:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So very high!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.18,0:21:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's ride this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.80,0:21:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gondola!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.38,0:21:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.14,0:22:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.50,0:22:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.48,0:22:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.48,0:22:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so excited! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.58,0:22:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.73,0:22:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.96,0:22:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.10,0:22:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.02,0:22:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,High Priest-A-Rouge, look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.54,0:22:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my, what a sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.00,0:22:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A celestial dragon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.70,0:22:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,to think they'd wander around the\Nlawless area without a care in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.36,0:22:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like this, but our only choice\Nis to kneel and let him pass on by.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.16,0:23:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sharia and father left\Nme, and in this cesspool,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.28,0:23:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,where did they wander off to this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.54,0:23:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we do know their final\Ndestination, so rest easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.28,0:23:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet up with them soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.70,0:23:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow as a turtle, you can't crawl\Ngracefully, but a horrible ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.94,0:23:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey you what are you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.48,0:23:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.20,0:23:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be still and proud
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.90,0:23:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.66,0:23:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please overlook this, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.38,0:23:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This man needs urgent care.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.40,0:23:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're reaching against time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.12,0:24:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The hospital is just up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.90,0:24:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.18,0:24:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is very bad indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.92,0:24:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, you must be swift.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.36,0:24:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And put him out of his misery!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.40,0:24:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you, stop! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.24,0:24:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.90,0:24:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that is one selfish noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.84,0:24:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what's more important?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.50,0:24:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Showing me courtesy or\Na mere commoner's life?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.18,0:24:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Every commoner owes their very\Nexistence to the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.30,0:24:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.34,0:24:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm making you my new wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.24,0:24:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.28,0:24:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall make arrangements to send her to\Nthe Holy Land as your thirteenth wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.84,0:24:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,By the by, I've grown quite weary\Nof wives one through five lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.64,0:24:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Have them sit back to\Nlive with the commoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.76,0:25:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, sir, as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.40,0:25:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.48,0:25:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.39,0:25:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.31,0:25:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She's my fiancée!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.22,0:25:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just come here and...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.42,0:25:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you speak to me\Nwhen you should be kneeling!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.18,0:25:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.46,0:25:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.98,0:25:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.72,0:25:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.24,0:25:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Help him, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.15,0:25:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.22,0:25:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.50,0:25:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,These celestial dragons are\Nas wicked as the rumors say.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.66,0:25:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.06,0:25:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You would have these\Npeople act out against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.10,0:25:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let go of me! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.68,0:25:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Take her ahead to the\Nharbor for me. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.76,0:25:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.44,0:25:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognize him, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.98,0:26:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's Pirate Hunter\NZoro from the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.78,0:26:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he walking right down\Nthe middle of the street?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.24,0:26:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't he know you don't\Ndo that around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.96,0:26:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to cause a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.58,0:26:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.52,0:26:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need some directions or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.00,0:26:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell does he think he's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.92,0:26:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.60,0:26:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.51,0:26:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.78,0:26:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you have to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.68,0:26:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you leave me? Nooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.62,0:26:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay still, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.62,0:26:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.53,0:26:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.60,0:27:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you stand up to a Celestial Dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.32,0:27:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You know they can only end in death!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.44,0:27:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I actually sought him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.62,0:27:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought for sure he\Ndodged at the last second,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.14,0:27:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but oh, well, must be imagining things.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.54,0:27:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.32,0:27:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.16,0:27:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck were you\Nthinking attacking a
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.28,0:27:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,celestial dragon like that\Nyou'll bring admirals?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.80,0:27:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Here what's with all this\Ntomato juice it's to make you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.52,0:27:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,look dead and unless you want\Nto be that way for real mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.26,0:27:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,troublemaker you better obey the unwritten
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.16,0:27:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,pirate rules what are you\Ntalking About hey? Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.74,0:27:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a kid here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.88,0:27:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.82,0:27:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get the rest of us\Ncaught up in your trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.06,0:28:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you messed up in the head?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.62,0:28:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.53,0:28:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't hit my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.45,0:28:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You numbskull!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.36,0:28:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about the inside! Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.68,0:28:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What a dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.64,0:28:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How have you survived this long?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.24,0:28:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.15,0:28:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to jewelry!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.07,0:28:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Barney over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.98,0:28:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We managed to avoid the\Nworst case scenario!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.50,0:28:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That man is a pirate on Azoro! A member?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.96,0:28:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,of the Straw Hat Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.32,0:28:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard their crew was kind of\Nwild, but attacking a dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.62,0:28:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and in a public street in broad daylight?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.66,0:28:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's plain bonkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.18,0:28:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only natural that he was saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.36,0:28:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't see the shadow of\Ndeath upon him at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.46,0:28:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt his bloodlust.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.98,0:28:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy will cut you down\Nwithout a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.44,0:28:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a real monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.02,0:28:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A bounty of 120 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.64,0:28:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem like a lackey, but\Nhe's number two on the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.04,0:28:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that goes to show\Nthe caliber of his captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.50,0:28:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, so, where's the\Nnearest hospital? Hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.90,0:28:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This man needs a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.58,0:28:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He took a bullet. What? Forget him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.92,0:28:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a total stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.42,0:28:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.16,0:28:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A pirate helping out some random guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.54,0:28:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Never seen that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.24,0:29:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw something when I went into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.84,0:29:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,These bubble bicycle\Nthings were flying around.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.06,0:29:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I saw those, too. Pretty cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.80,0:29:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We should buy a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.84,0:29:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you those bikes\Nhave a real smooth ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.80,0:29:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.71,0:29:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.94,0:29:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Click.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.04,0:29:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, my beautiful Nami! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.46,0:29:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji and Chopper, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.30,0:29:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Basically, they had so many kinds of ice\Ncream, we got caught up and made a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.42,0:29:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow down, you're not making any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.50,0:29:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Sanji, it's terrible! Terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.90,0:29:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.70,0:29:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're saying. Calm\Ndown. Just start over. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.24,0:30:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't even have a clue what kidnapter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.56,0:30:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is gigantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.56,0:30:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to split up and start...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.86,0:30:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.77,0:30:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me exactly where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.36,0:30:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll come and meet you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.10,0:30:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But we...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.28,0:30:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We know some experts when it comes\Nto this sort of thing, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.48,0:30:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm calling in the Flying Fish Riders.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.90,0:30:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.78,0:30:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.48,0:30:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Handsome's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.42,0:30:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.36,0:30:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, Duval's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.48,0:30:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So are we!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.24,0:30:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you, young Master Blackleg?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.20,0:30:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Angry, because you fish\Nriders took too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.64,0:30:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not fish riders anymore,\Nyoung Master, you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.48,0:30:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the Rosie Life Riders now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.48,0:30:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're freaking annoying, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.00,0:30:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.12,0:30:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our mermaid friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.40,0:30:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She got kidnapped in Sabaody Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.80,0:30:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I called you to help us find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.02,0:31:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not kidnappers?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.24,0:31:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.42,0:31:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They sound like devious villains!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.68,0:31:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys were kidnappers\Ntoo, like what, yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.22,0:31:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They say it takes a thief to catch one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.44,0:31:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.56,0:31:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys up for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.48,0:31:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.39,0:31:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall do our very best to serve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.22,0:31:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wish is our command.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.76,0:31:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we really trust these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.50,0:31:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and by the by, before I came here, I\Nshowed off my new looks to some ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.62,0:31:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't quite the success\Nthat I imagined I would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.44,0:31:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can fix your\Nface, but not your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.04,0:31:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Or your annoying personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.94,0:31:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.28,0:31:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.58,0:31:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.50,0:31:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We just need to find your mermaid\Nfriend before she gets sold, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.82,0:31:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.80,0:31:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're from around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.06,0:31:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I figure you must know the\Narchipelago better than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.78,0:31:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, of course we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.36,0:31:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabo Odi is our backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.64,0:31:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We know all the ins and outs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.44,0:31:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't find a better\Ntour guide than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.80,0:31:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, hop on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.70,0:31:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking the flying fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.64,0:31:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.04,0:31:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, ready when you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.50,0:31:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.41,0:31:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, how do you guys plan on finding her?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.36,0:32:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, don't fret.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.66,0:32:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Those of a trade know each other's ways,\Nand we were once kidnappers as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.10,0:32:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can think of a few groups\Nalready that might be responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.68,0:32:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,First off,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.62,0:32:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll take a quick cruise\Nacross the groves and pick up
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.82,0:32:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,the rest of your crew so they\Ncan help with the search.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.08,0:32:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,In the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.28,0:32:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll try and find out which\Nkidnappers grabbed your mermaid friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.72,0:32:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.68,0:32:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.42,0:32:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.32,0:32:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope this works out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.24,0:32:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.74,0:32:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.76,0:32:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay right there\Nand don't move an inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.86,0:32:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send someone there to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.72,0:32:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.63,0:32:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Calic.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.36,0:32:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.27,0:32:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji says not to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.62,0:32:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to be safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.92,0:32:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,we should still wait here instead\Nof breaking up the group even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.44,0:32:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think, Brook?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.48,0:33:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me put it this way Sanji gave us very
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.70,0:33:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,specific instructions\Nto stay here and wait
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.96,0:33:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,for someone to come\Npick us up and no matter
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.30,0:33:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,what we do our wait will be just as long?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.40,0:33:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, head. We made it to\NSabaody Park. What's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.90,0:33:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Find the rest of the Straw Hats\Nand pick up one member each.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.10,0:33:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.20,0:33:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They were supposed to wait by public\Ntransponder snail number five,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.36,0:33:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,which should be right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.60,0:33:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.24,0:33:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,See, on the bench.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.62,0:33:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Brooke and Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.92,0:33:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you guys, we're ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.18,0:33:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, let's...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.16,0:34:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you two so relaxed?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.62,0:34:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.36,0:34:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.12,0:34:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Operation Save Kuma at\Nall costs is underway!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.34,0:34:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.25,0:34:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go all out!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.44,0:34:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No relaxing!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.70,0:34:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But he got mad at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.20,0:34:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it then, I regret it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.14,0:34:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little bit, but I regret it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.02,0:34:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep on the lookout for every\Nkidnapping team on the archipelago!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.28,0:34:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be one of them, so\Nit's only a matter of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.90,0:34:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know the other Straw Hats ran\Noff, but we still got to find them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.36,0:34:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.27,0:34:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's split up. Ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.62,0:34:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're betting our pride on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.48,0:34:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not let the young master down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.62,0:34:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do this fast and do it right, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.50,0:34:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That should be good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.94,0:34:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Good enough for who?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.98,0:34:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And can't you do something\Nabout this slow-ass cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.42,0:34:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'd have known it was like\Nthis, I would have got on a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.94,0:34:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.85,0:34:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You said I'm handsome?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.82,0:34:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.98,0:34:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, you're the head of your gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.64,0:34:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you stuck on the slowest\Nride when everyone else can fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.14,0:34:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you say something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.28,0:34:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm the most\Nhandsome person on the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.80,0:34:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.94,0:35:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and step on it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.84,0:35:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.86,0:35:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you swear no one came\Nhere to sell a mermaid?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.38,0:35:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I swear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.92,0:35:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No one today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.83,0:35:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.75,0:35:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll only be harder on\Nus if you cause trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.00,0:35:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Octoguy, let's look around the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.14,0:35:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.90,0:35:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.96,0:35:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you guys have any luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.86,0:35:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, looks like he was\Ntelling the truth. Jamie!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.84,0:35:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.18,0:35:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to look somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.92,0:35:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I just remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.50,0:35:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention\Nit, I do have a mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.06,0:35:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,For real? Do you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.70,0:35:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.00,0:35:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This pretty little thing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.76,0:35:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name's Mari.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.98,0:35:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If you like her, I'll\Ncut you guys a good deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.30,0:35:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to take me home?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.42,0:35:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way in hell that's a mermaid!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.60,0:35:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw him in the shop just a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.78,0:35:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really hard to breathe in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.86,0:36:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.72,0:36:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.98,0:36:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.30,0:36:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You, don't lose hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.58,0:36:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she hasn't been sold yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.18,0:36:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We just gotta figure out\Nwhich kidnappers grabbed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.46,0:36:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.12,0:36:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's Straw Hat Luffy\Nfrom the East Blue, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.86,0:36:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's shorter than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.00,0:36:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.98,0:36:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The amusement park is the number one\Nspot for kidnappers to pick people up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.04,0:36:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew they'd be on the lookout for a\Nmermaid like her but I didn't do a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.44,0:36:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa they've got all\Nkinds of ice cream here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.90,0:36:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What flavor do you want? Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.02,0:36:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta go see it for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.38,0:36:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.08,0:36:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma you wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.22,0:36:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.64,0:36:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But get something yummy for me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.24,0:36:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.66,0:36:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm never going to see her again, and the\Nlast thing I said was about ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.18,0:36:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.66,0:36:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I never should have let her\Ngo to that amusement park.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.02,0:36:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.90,0:37:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just, I've dreamed of this\Nmoment ever since I was a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.36,0:37:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been so high\Nup in the air before.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.78,0:37:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always remember this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.30,0:37:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.08,0:37:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't do anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.90,0:37:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She was really happy we got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.56,0:37:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nobody's fault it\Nturned out like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.62,0:37:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.94,0:37:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Truth is It's a terrible idea for fishmen\Nand merfolk to come to this place at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.66,0:37:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But hachi he wanted to help you\Nguys after what you did for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.90,0:37:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And I felt the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.96,0:37:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Papagu, don't say anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.06,0:37:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're stuck like this\Neither way You might as
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.04,0:37:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,well tell me why it's so\Nbad for you to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.28,0:37:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.22,0:37:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The kidnappers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.22,0:37:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not the only enemies\NKuma and Hachi have in Sabo Odi.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.58,0:37:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact You might say everyone in\Nthe whole archipelago is their enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.60,0:37:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Two hundred years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.38,0:37:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's more recent\Nthan you would think.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.84,0:37:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But things used to be quite terrible here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.12,0:37:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The fishmen and merfolk races\Nwere considered the same as fish,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.48,0:37:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and humans all over the world\Npersecuted them in every possible way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.26,0:38:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They were seen as lesser than human,\Nand they were treated as such.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.80,0:38:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a surprise since\Nthey're so strong. Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.24,0:38:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But strength in numbers is greater still,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.70,0:38:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and they were treated cruelly by everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.78,0:38:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,until the world government declared\Nfriendly relations with Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.90,0:38:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Slavery is another relic\Nfrom that unfortunate past,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.68,0:38:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and human trafficking is still\Nvery alive on this archipelago.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.14,0:38:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, it may even be condoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.66,0:38:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If such a deplorable\Ntradition still remains?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.22,0:38:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't surprise me if\Nthey continue to discriminate.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.52,0:38:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,against Fishman and Murfolk here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.70,0:38:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Persecution?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.61,0:38:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a fool if you can't see\Nthis place for what it really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.34,0:38:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The human trafficking is\Njust the icing on the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.92,0:38:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But I should know better.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.88,0:38:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So I blame myself for not\Nstopping Kuma when we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.88,0:38:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That explains the disguises.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.74,0:38:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't want people to know\Nthat they weren't human, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.40,0:38:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope these fears\Nof mine are unfounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.08,0:38:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin! Carol!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.82,0:38:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.73,0:38:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just call me Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.02,0:39:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.16,0:39:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on the flying fish quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.14,0:39:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody kidnapped the mer-chick!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.04,0:39:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They took Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.98,0:39:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.62,0:39:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.74,0:39:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.58,0:39:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to help, not cause more trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.82,0:39:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a mess, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.12,0:39:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you guys talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.64,0:39:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop apologizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.84,0:39:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't anything to be sorry for.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.78,0:39:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All three of you are my friends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.98,0:39:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.46,0:39:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.02,0:39:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're going to rescue Kuma\Nno matter what, okay? Don't cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.36,0:39:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.27,0:39:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.19,0:39:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, what's up? We\Nfinally found you. Now get
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.76,0:39:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Up here, I'll do guy. Can you\Njump that high? Whoa, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.88,0:40:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All right I'm expecting some good results\Nthis time worry you're gonna make a
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.74,0:40:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Killing they'll love this one come by in a
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.34,0:40:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,few hours and we'll have your money Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.22,0:40:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.58,0:40:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.28,0:40:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an honor to have you here, St.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.50,0:40:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Roswald and St. Shalria. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.22,0:40:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Could we refrain from kneeling\Nin the auction house, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.74,0:40:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It would make our jobs very difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.76,0:40:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.70,0:40:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want a boring auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.48,0:40:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's very generous of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.22,0:40:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, use the VIP seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.42,0:40:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother's certainly\Ntaking his time getting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.66,0:40:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what the fool gets\Nfor riding a sluggish human.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.70,0:40:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're going to ride\Nsomething, make it a fish man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.18,0:40:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,They may be filthy, but they're\Nten times stronger than humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.40,0:40:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Celestial dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.30,0:40:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.21,0:40:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Human shops.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.34,0:40:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.70,0:41:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's Captain\NKidd from the South Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.72,0:41:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When the people in power\Nact this cruel and greedy,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.02,0:41:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,it makes common criminals like us\Nlook pretty humane by comparison.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.54,0:41:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,When scum like that are the ones\Nwriting the rules, it creates more scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.18,0:41:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They hate pirates, but they're\Nthe ones who made them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.94,0:41:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,At least we're as endearing\Nas we are mean, right, killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.90,0:41:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.22,0:41:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.13,0:41:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If we see someone interesting, you\Nthink we should try and buy them?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.36,0:41:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss, take a look. See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.50,0:41:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.66,0:41:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Trafalgar Law from the North Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.74,0:41:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Worth $200 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.88,0:41:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard some pretty\Nugly rumors about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.88,0:41:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be a fan of mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.44,0:41:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Disco!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.35,0:41:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got an incredible item today!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.44,0:41:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, I've already seen the giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.60,0:41:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.56,0:42:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, I'll make\Nsure it sells for a high price.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.52,0:42:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, are\Nthe buy bidders ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.56,0:42:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not the giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.12,0:42:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a mermaid!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.24,0:42:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and she's young, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.70,0:42:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be an auction for\Nthe record books. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.78,0:42:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.96,0:42:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hurting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.18,0:42:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.04,0:42:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.36,0:42:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,so you might as well stop flopping\Nlike that, you stupid fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.30,0:42:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now, let's not roughhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.28,0:42:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Our important merchandise\Nquite so much, sorry, disco.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.36,0:42:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the star of today's show?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.50,0:42:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.82,0:42:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.44,0:42:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not only young, she's lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.32,0:42:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll fetch a high price, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.80,0:42:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who submitted her?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.90,0:42:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The hound pets, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.04,0:42:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Peterman.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.46,0:43:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He always does fine work.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.50,0:43:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The flying Fish riders on the other hand\Nhaven't turned in a thing this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.22,0:43:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, in any case, this is sure\Nto Be the biggest auction in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.78,0:43:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.64,0:43:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,dare make a face at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.08,0:43:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.66,0:43:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.12,0:43:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.34,0:43:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She's awful, sir, but she's\Nvaluable merchandise, like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.20,0:43:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.11,0:43:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We need her in good shape\Nfor the auction, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.24,0:43:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick her in the stomach or somewhere\Nthat's covered up by clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.44,0:43:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Pajun is going to beat you up so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.56,0:43:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.72,0:43:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know when to shut\Nthat filthy mouth, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.46,0:43:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You there, give me that collar.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.10,0:43:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.68,0:43:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put this on you myself, fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.22,0:43:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.26,0:44:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Disco?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.17,0:44:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Disco?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.09,0:44:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened? Are you okay? Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.70,0:44:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The auction's about to start!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.22,0:44:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor! Get a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.52,0:44:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.74,0:44:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.22,0:44:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't play dumb with\Nme, that Haki there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.48,0:44:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It was yours, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.12,0:44:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who in the hell are you, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.10,0:44:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.01,0:44:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a simple ship\NKatorea. Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.20,0:44:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.54,0:44:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a soft spot for young girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.34,0:44:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I may have overdone it a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.30,0:44:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
